      FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
      "cd0d3178-34e9-4650-af8d-381cac7e9e5a"],
     " resolves by the count: ",
     Cell[BoxData["All"], "InlineFormula",
      FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
      "0486318f-78f0-405d-aea4-8f6233e7c9b6"],
