     Cell[BoxData["\"\<Exhaustive\>\""], "InlineFormula",
      FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
      "f04e9258-e393-4a26-aded-d95e8723f2dc"],
     ", the pool; a bounded count to ",
     Cell[BoxData["\"\<RandomGreedy\>\""], "InlineFormula",
      FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
      "30611054-65a4-4a00-ada8-8c1726f6d8b7"],
     ", the DAG descended in random branch order \[LongDash] put ",
     Cell[BoxData["SeedRandom"], "InlineFormula",
      FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
      "c68bb7fb-2f65-452b-9f4f-285d2cddc3ce"],
     " in front of a call whose output goes into a figure. The class is the \
