Cell["\<\
Both geodesics from 1 to its antipode on the 6-cycle are rays: nothing lies \
farther from 1 than 4.\
\>", "ExampleText",ExpressionUUID->"80dfb340-86cb-41c7-a4dd-574586fa7e88"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{
